WEBVTT

00:05.460 --> 00:09.050
<b>So you've finally decided to play for keeps,
Avos Dilhevia?</b>

00:09.630 --> 00:13.170
<b>But you're too late.</b>

01:46.530 --> 01:50.960
<b>12 - THE MISFIT</b>

01:49.730 --> 01:52.070
<b>Play for keeps?
Too late?</b>

01:52.570 --> 01:55.070
<b>Are you out of your mind?</b>

01:56.240 --> 02:01.120
<b>The biggest and most powerful Magic Sword
that makes you the Demon King of Tyranny...</b>

02:01.120 --> 02:02.490
<b>...is now in my hands.</b>

02:02.950 --> 02:06.250
<b>You've lost your name,
your subordinates, your castle...</b>

02:06.250 --> 02:09.870
<b>...and as of now,
even the symbol of your power.</b>

02:10.250 --> 02:14.800
<b>Do you really think that you can defeat me,
the Demon King of Tyranny,</b>

02:14.800 --> 02:16.760
<b>when you've been reduced
to just Anos Voldigoad?</b>

02:16.760 --> 02:21.050
<b>I see that acquiring a ragged stick
has given your confidence a boost.</b>

02:21.300 --> 02:23.760
<b>If you have any confidence yourself,</b>

02:23.760 --> 02:26.390
<b>then use your power,
not words, to show it!</b>

02:26.810 --> 02:29.560
<b>I'll be happy to finish you off in an instant.</b>

02:30.230 --> 02:31.440
<b>Let's see you try it.</b>

02:35.230 --> 02:36.940
<b>- Jio Graze.
- Jio Graze.</b>

02:39.530 --> 02:41.070
<b>Jirasd!</b>

02:42.620 --> 02:43.660
<b>Zolye Dypt!</b>

02:46.740 --> 02:48.250
<b>Ih Guneas.</b>

02:53.420 --> 02:57.800
<b>Did you really think you could block that
by using the Demonic Eyes of Destruction?</b>

03:01.550 --> 03:03.470
<b>When you're up against Venuzdnor,</b>

03:03.470 --> 03:07.390
<b>even the wall dividing the world
is no more than a sheet of paper.</b>

03:13.480 --> 03:15.940
<b>Now please, meet your demise.</b>

03:17.360 --> 03:20.530
<b>H-How could this happen?</b>

03:21.450 --> 03:25.280
<b>I'm positive that I had Venuzdnor in my hand.</b>

03:25.280 --> 03:29.620
<b>Did you really think that with the Magic Sword
of Destruction in hand, you could beat me?</b>

03:29.830 --> 03:37.000
<b>Why can't I see it? The bottom of your abyss?
When I'm the Demon King of Tyranny?</b>

03:37.300 --> 03:41.510
<b>That's your answer.
You're nothing but rumors and traditions.</b>

03:44.470 --> 03:47.600
<b>You're a fake.
Avos Dilhevia!</b>

03:56.360 --> 03:58.900
<b>This isn't over yet.</b>

03:59.190 --> 04:02.320
<b>I'm the biological child
of the Great Spirit Mother Leno,</b>

04:02.320 --> 04:05.070
<b>as well as the Demon King of Tyranny,
Avos Dilhevia.</b>

04:05.070 --> 04:08.950
<b>And I'm also the Child
of God who will destroy you.</b>

04:10.290 --> 04:13.920
<b>The Child of God has followed
the prescribed plan,</b>

04:14.580 --> 04:17.250
<b>and acquired the Magic Sword of Destruction.</b>

04:22.090 --> 04:24.630
<b>It is time for you to awaken.</b>

04:25.590 --> 04:27.890
<b>Anos Voldigoad.</b>

04:28.140 --> 04:32.430
<b>I still have everything in my grasp.</b>

04:36.560 --> 04:37.940
<b>Wh-What's going on?</b>

04:38.150 --> 04:39.940
<b>What is this?</b>

04:39.940 --> 04:41.280
<b>Anos...</b>

04:41.610 --> 04:46.490
<b>In the past, the Demon King of Tyranny caused
the Goddess of Destruction, Abernyu,</b>

04:46.490 --> 04:50.030
<b>to fall to the earth, and renamed her
as the Demon Palace Delsgade.</b>

04:50.540 --> 04:55.330
<b>Moreover, her divine powers and order
of destruction were concentrated into a miracle,</b>

04:55.330 --> 04:58.670
<b>and renamed the Magic Sword of Destruction,
Venuzdnor.</b>

04:58.960 --> 05:02.710
<b>But order will eventually recover
its original reason.</b>

05:02.710 --> 05:05.510
<b>What do you think will happen
when that time comes?</b>

05:05.880 --> 05:09.470
<b>The repercussions of the destruction
that never happened will be upon us.</b>

05:09.470 --> 05:12.020
<b>For as long as they've
been repressed over the years,</b>

05:12.020 --> 05:14.930
<b>their power will expand to unthinkable levels!</b>

05:17.770 --> 05:21.860
<b>Show me order, Child of God,
Avos Dilhevia.</b>

05:21.860 --> 05:25.740
<b>Use your massive magic power
to awaken the Goddess of Destruction.</b>

05:25.820 --> 05:30.070
<b>As the law decrees, annihilate
the two Demon Kings of Tyranny.</b>

05:30.070 --> 05:33.080
<b>Along with every living being in existence!</b>

05:36.620 --> 05:40.500
<b>Now, then. Look to the heavens.
You miserable fools.</b>

05:41.000 --> 05:42.670
<b>The miracle of the Goddess of Destruction,</b>

05:42.670 --> 05:46.550
<b>who brought on all death
and destruction during the Mythical Age.</b>

05:47.220 --> 05:52.930
<b>The Sun of Ruin Sir Gerldonave
will now be resurrected.</b>

06:09.610 --> 06:13.450
<b>Gods are order.
We have neither a will, nor a soul.</b>

06:13.450 --> 06:16.620
<b>Tragedies are always caused
by foolish living beings.</b>

06:16.620 --> 06:18.960
<b>This is retribution.</b>

06:18.960 --> 06:21.250
<b>Just because it's the order of destruction...</b>

06:21.250 --> 06:23.540
<b>...did you really think I'd ally myself
with the gods?</b>

06:24.380 --> 06:26.670
<b>Assuming the role of a bystander,</b>

06:26.670 --> 06:31.340
<b>and laying the blame for all of the tragedies
of the past 2,000 years?</b>

06:31.340 --> 06:33.680
<b>This world doesn't need a god of such.</b>

06:34.100 --> 06:38.480
<b>Impossible. The Goddess of Destruction
is the order that destroys all things.</b>

06:38.480 --> 06:41.190
<b>How can it not destroy a single demon?</b>

06:41.400 --> 06:44.400
<b>That's merely a decree
that you people put into place.</b>

06:44.400 --> 06:47.320
<b>But I won't adhere to such a thing.</b>

06:47.570 --> 06:53.200
<b>No matter how you may deviate,
you can't possibly protect all the others!</b>

06:53.530 --> 06:55.540
<b>Order fears me, then?</b>

06:55.910 --> 06:58.000
<b>Gods fear nothing!</b>

06:58.200 --> 07:00.540
<b>Then you should step back now.</b>

07:00.540 --> 07:03.000
<b>Go on and formulate some other new plan.</b>

07:03.580 --> 07:05.710
<b>I think I'll do just that.</b>

07:07.210 --> 07:11.300
<b>What? What did you do to me?
Demon King of Tyranny!</b>

07:12.050 --> 07:15.850
<b>Don't you get it, NousGalia?
That's fear.</b>

07:17.600 --> 07:22.650
<b>Y-You cannot destroy me!</b>

07:22.900 --> 07:24.770
<b>Should you kill the Heavenly God Father,</b>

07:24.770 --> 07:28.030
<b>it will only set the world on
the path to utter destruction!</b>

07:28.030 --> 07:29.110
<b>You have a point there.</b>

07:30.490 --> 07:33.240
<b>Did you really think that I'd say that?</b>

07:33.870 --> 07:39.160
<b>What's the matter? If you really have no soul,
then you wouldn't fear being destroyed.</b>

07:39.160 --> 07:41.410
<b>Or are you about to tell me
that you wish to live?</b>

07:41.710 --> 07:46.170
<b>I would never... I am order.</b>

07:46.670 --> 07:47.750
<b>Let's see you laugh.</b>

07:47.750 --> 07:48.880
<b>What?</b>

07:48.880 --> 07:52.720
<b>If you can laugh under these circumstances,
then you are order.</b>

07:52.720 --> 07:54.300
<b>You'd have no malice.</b>

07:54.300 --> 07:57.850
<b>I'll deal with you accordingly,
but I won't destroy you.</b>

07:58.060 --> 08:02.020
<b>But if you fear me,
and cannot bring yourself to laugh,</b>

08:02.020 --> 08:05.100
<b>then it will mean that you have a soul.</b>

08:05.100 --> 08:07.020
<b>I couldn't discard of you, then.</b>

08:07.690 --> 08:11.490
<b>I'm going to count three seconds.
Show me order in that time.</b>

08:13.400 --> 08:14.200
<b>Three...</b>

08:14.530 --> 08:15.280
<b>Two...</b>

08:15.820 --> 08:16.870
<b>One—</b>

08:17.910 --> 08:22.210
<b>You just laughed, NousGalia.
Meaning you wish to live?</b>

08:22.210 --> 08:26.130
<b>Looks like you just proved yourself
that you're not order at all.</b>

08:28.250 --> 08:30.170
<b>Curse you!</b>

08:30.170 --> 08:33.720
<b>You would insult me... all gods?</b>

08:36.010 --> 08:38.220
<b>Erdomaid. Time for a contract.</b>

08:38.220 --> 08:42.390
<b>If you declare that you won't defy me,
I'll give you whatever you wish.</b>

08:44.600 --> 08:47.940
<b>I've been waiting to hear you say
those very words, Demon King!</b>

08:49.270 --> 08:50.270
<b>Zecht.</b>

08:50.650 --> 08:51.980
<b>Zecht.</b>

08:53.190 --> 08:54.650
<b>Wh-What did you...?</b>

08:54.990 --> 08:59.370
<b>Just as you said, if I were to destroy order,
the world would collapse with it.</b>

08:59.370 --> 09:03.620
<b>So I just need to transfer all
of your power to the Blaze Death King.</b>

09:03.830 --> 09:09.000
<b>Divine power is absolute...
you can't give it to some diminutive demon—</b>

09:09.250 --> 09:11.460
<b>Oh? You haven't realized, then?</b>

09:12.000 --> 09:19.890
<b><i>For 2,000 years, Erdomaid has been formulating magic spells</i>
<i>to usurp divine powers with his own source.</i></b>

09:20.180 --> 09:25.270
<b><i>It took him longer than expected to analyze them,</i>
<i>but now all he has to do is perfect them.</i></b>

09:25.430 --> 09:29.400
<b>What a foolish man... to think
that he could usurp divine powers!</b>

09:29.650 --> 09:32.690
<b>Why don't I turn you into an insect?</b>

09:32.690 --> 09:35.280
<b>Eternally... no matter how many times
you reincarnate yourself.</b>

09:35.280 --> 09:35.990
<b>What—</b>

09:36.240 --> 09:39.280
<b>It's fun, you know, having a soul.</b>

09:39.700 --> 09:44.750
<b>A much more stimulating life
than this dull order of yours.</b>

09:44.870 --> 09:48.620
<b>Order will be disrupted... you fool...</b>

09:48.620 --> 09:51.630
<b>Curse you... curse you...</b>

09:51.630 --> 09:54.090
<b>Curse you!</b>

09:54.260 --> 09:59.890
<b>You cursed misfit who's strayed
from the laws of the world, from order!</b>

10:00.140 --> 10:03.970
<b>Listen to you,
sounding just like a proper insect.</b>

10:03.970 --> 10:08.060
<b>You're the one who's disrupting order!
Gods have no souls!</b>

10:08.060 --> 10:12.860
<b>You instilled emotions into a god,
and you're disrupting order—that's all!</b>

10:12.860 --> 10:17.320
<b>One day, you'll destroy the world
and lead it to extinction!</b>

10:17.320 --> 10:21.370
<b>Divine prophesies are absolute!</b>

10:32.960 --> 10:36.050
<b>But how impressive was that, Demon King!</b>

10:36.260 --> 10:42.010
<b>To perfect Ji Schenzu so effortlessly,
and actually usurp divine powers!</b>

10:45.100 --> 10:48.060
<b>The most powerful, the most evil,
the most unbeatable of all!</b>

10:48.060 --> 10:51.270
<b>So invincible, you must long for enemies!</b>

11:03.780 --> 11:05.740
<b>Looks like it's over.</b>

11:05.740 --> 11:06.700
<b>Yes.</b>

11:12.210 --> 11:13.500
<b>Are you all right?</b>

11:17.550 --> 11:19.300
<b>Look how big you are now!</b>

11:19.840 --> 11:22.640
<b>Are you my mother?</b>

11:22.640 --> 11:26.350
<b>Yes. I finally got to hold you close.</b>

11:29.980 --> 11:33.060
<b>I'm sorry that I can't stay with you forever.</b>

11:33.310 --> 11:37.690
<b>Wait... N-Not yet... Don't go yet!</b>

11:37.690 --> 11:40.190
<b>Just a little... just a little longer!</b>

11:40.570 --> 11:46.280
<b>I love you, Misa.
I'm really glad that I had you.</b>

11:46.530 --> 11:48.120
<b>Oh.</b>

11:53.830 --> 11:57.340
<b>Shin. Thank you. And also...</b>

12:00.590 --> 12:02.590
<b>I was so happy.</b>

12:03.680 --> 12:06.850
<b>Leno. I... love you.</b>

12:16.860 --> 12:18.400
<b>Mother...</b>

12:19.690 --> 12:22.610
<b>Please... please... Fran!</b>

12:23.150 --> 12:27.870
<b>Please let me see my mother one more time.
You can do that, can't you?</b>

12:27.870 --> 12:31.870
<b>If you could do it now,
then why can't you...</b>

12:32.830 --> 12:36.880
<b>Just a little longer...
where's the harm in that?</b>

12:51.100 --> 12:53.600
<b>That one doesn't have the power to do that.</b>

12:55.100 --> 12:59.150
<b>All she can do is bring an end
to this tragedy.</b>

12:59.320 --> 13:04.070
<b>It's all my fault.
Because I was born...</b>

13:04.070 --> 13:05.400
<b>You're wrong about that.</b>

13:06.110 --> 13:09.280
<b>Wrong how, exactly?</b>

13:09.280 --> 13:12.870
<b>It's because I was born...
it violated her rumors and traditions.</b>

13:16.170 --> 13:19.460
<b>Misa, have I ever said anything just
to give you peace of mind?</b>

13:19.460 --> 13:20.960
<b>But...</b>

13:20.960 --> 13:22.880
<b>Leno hasn't disappeared.</b>

13:24.130 --> 13:27.180
<b>But first I have to save you.</b>

13:28.340 --> 13:31.720
<b>Because now that you've
been separated from Avos Dilhevia,</b>

13:31.720 --> 13:33.310
<b>your source is starting to disintegrate.</b>

13:34.350 --> 13:38.980
<b>Lay, use the Spirit God Sword to kill Misa,
just as the rumors and traditions say.</b>

13:38.980 --> 13:39.650
<b>- What?
- What?</b>

13:40.480 --> 13:42.650
<b>I wish I could explain it to you.</b>

13:42.650 --> 13:44.320
<b>But we're running out of time.</b>

13:46.860 --> 13:47.860
<b>Are you ready?</b>

13:48.320 --> 13:50.280
<b>Sure. I'll trust you on this.</b>

13:50.990 --> 13:53.200
<b>Please do what you need to do,
Lord Anos.</b>

14:13.140 --> 14:19.140
<b>The Demon King of Tyranny's rumors
and traditions had shaped half of Misa's source.</b>

14:19.440 --> 14:23.020
<b>If Avos is killed,
Misa won't be able to survive, either.</b>

14:23.360 --> 14:26.440
<b>Because the two halves can't be completely severed.</b>

14:26.860 --> 14:30.360
<b>So we'll need to turn her into another spirit
who only shares her name.</b>

14:31.910 --> 14:34.330
<b>She can't be reincarnated into a normal spirit.</b>

14:34.330 --> 14:37.620
<b>If we were to instill her with rumors
and traditions that violate Avos's spiritual root,</b>

14:37.620 --> 14:39.250
<b>it would only shorten her lifespan.</b>

14:39.620 --> 14:43.790
<b>So what should we do?
Create the rest of her traditions.</b>

14:45.380 --> 14:48.550
<b>The resurrected Demon King of Tyranny
is once again annihilated...</b>

14:48.550 --> 14:50.260
<b>...and reincarnates.</b>

14:50.550 --> 14:54.140
<b><i>As a pure spirit named Misa,</i>
<i>rather than a half-spirit, half-demon,</i></b>

14:54.140 --> 14:56.470
<b><i>she will regain her original form.</i></b>

14:56.890 --> 15:00.230
<b>This tradition is already being
spread among the humans.</b>

15:01.310 --> 15:02.480
<b><i>Thanks to Igareth.</i></b>

15:03.860 --> 15:07.900
<b>Demons and half-spirits,
half-demons are born from their parents.</b>

15:07.900 --> 15:10.610
<b>A spirit is produced naturally,
or else...</b>

15:12.490 --> 15:14.410
<b><i>Generated by chaos.</i></b>

15:16.540 --> 15:19.830
<b>Great Spirit who was revived here,
and then expired...</b>

15:23.000 --> 15:27.800
<b>After 2,000 years, it's time
for your sorrow to change to joy.</b>

15:29.090 --> 15:32.550
<b>The Great Spirit Mother died because
by giving birth to a demon,</b>

15:32.550 --> 15:35.970
<b>she'd violated her own rumors and traditions.</b>

15:35.970 --> 15:39.270
<b>But according to the next part
of her tradition now being spread anew,</b>

15:39.270 --> 15:41.940
<b>Avos Dilhevia has become a spirit.</b>

15:41.940 --> 15:46.440
<b>Meaning that there's no longer any reason
for Leno to have died.</b>

15:50.690 --> 15:51.820
<b>Leno...</b>

15:59.790 --> 16:00.830
<b>Misa...</b>

16:08.340 --> 16:10.300
<b>Mother...</b>

16:16.050 --> 16:17.760
<b>Mother...</b>

16:17.930 --> 16:20.640
<b>Mother!</b>

16:20.640 --> 16:23.350
<b>Don't cry, now.
It's all right.</b>

16:23.350 --> 16:25.480
<b>I'm right here, Misa.</b>

16:26.440 --> 16:29.980
<b>And I'll always be...
I'll always be by your side.</b>

16:54.760 --> 16:55.720
<b>Misa?</b>

16:56.720 --> 16:57.590
<b>Are you all right?</b>

16:57.590 --> 16:59.390
<b>Y-Yes!</b>

17:04.350 --> 17:08.480
<b>Shin. I hear that you still haven't
spoken much to Misa yet.</b>

17:08.860 --> 17:11.190
<b>I don't know what I should say to her.</b>

17:11.190 --> 17:15.990
<b>Misa is about to appear before
the people as the fake Demon King.</b>

17:17.110 --> 17:19.950
<b>She's filled with anxiety.
Go talk to her.</b>

17:21.160 --> 17:22.490
<b>Understood.</b>

17:26.540 --> 17:28.210
<b>Father...</b>

17:28.210 --> 17:28.960
<b>Yes...</b>

17:29.630 --> 17:31.880
<b>Uh... um...</b>

17:31.880 --> 17:32.550
<b>Yes.</b>

17:33.670 --> 17:37.630
<b>I'm sorry!
I was a little nervous.</b>

17:37.630 --> 17:42.260
<b>N-No reason to lose my nerve now.
Though I can't seem to help it.</b>

17:42.260 --> 17:45.020
<b>I-I'm fine... I'm going to do it!</b>

17:46.270 --> 17:51.480
<b>It will be a brutal ordeal, but you're not one
to lose her nerve over such a thing.</b>

17:51.820 --> 17:53.030
<b>What?</b>

17:53.030 --> 17:54.860
<b>I've been watching you all this time.</b>

17:54.860 --> 17:58.360
<b>I saw you join the Unitarians
in order to meet me.</b>

17:58.360 --> 18:02.870
<b>And I saw you harden your resolve further
for the sake of the friends you made there.</b>

18:03.740 --> 18:07.790
<b>You've grown into a kind, strong girl
who'll never cave in to tragedy.</b>

18:09.040 --> 18:10.830
<b>Father...</b>

18:10.830 --> 18:13.050
<b>Father!</b>

18:13.050 --> 18:13.710
<b>Misa.</b>

18:17.130 --> 18:21.800
<b>I'll be fine now.
This is no time to be nervous, right?</b>

18:21.800 --> 18:26.270
<b>After all, Dilhade will go back
to being what it should be...</b>

18:26.270 --> 18:28.690
<b>...a place where hybrids
and Royals can coexist in peace.</b>

18:41.370 --> 18:44.580
<b>Look up now,
demon descendants.</b>

18:45.870 --> 18:50.920
<b>2,000 years ago,
we demons battled the humans and the spirits.</b>

18:51.380 --> 18:53.250
<b>The war was so long as to be tedious,</b>

18:53.540 --> 18:55.840
<b>and it seemed as if there was no end in sight.</b>

18:56.300 --> 18:59.380
<b>But today... it finally ended.</b>

18:59.930 --> 19:03.760
<b>Like us, they desired peace.</b>

19:04.760 --> 19:09.770
<b>The hero of Azeshion, who battled
the demons for supremacy, Hero Kanon.</b>

19:10.270 --> 19:14.230
<b>The queen ruling over Aharthern.
The Great Spirit, Leno.</b>

19:14.650 --> 19:19.070
<b>The Spirit King, Shin, who proved
that demons and spirits could be friends.</b>

19:19.400 --> 19:23.410
<b>And, born from the Demon King
of Tyranny's rumors and traditions,</b>

19:23.410 --> 19:27.370
<b>a Great Spirit as well
as the Child of God, Avos Dilhevia.</b>

19:27.370 --> 19:31.040
<b>Reincarnated after being felled
by the Hero Kanon's Holy Sword,</b>

19:31.040 --> 19:35.040
<b>she has sheathed her blade,
and appeared here. Her name is Misa.</b>

19:35.630 --> 19:37.840
<b>There's no longer any need
for blades of hatred.</b>

19:38.130 --> 19:41.130
<b>This hand is for taking
the hand of my neighbor!</b>

19:48.140 --> 19:49.680
<b>I'm issuing a decree now.</b>

19:49.680 --> 19:53.190
<b>All who live in Dilhade are equal.</b>

19:53.600 --> 19:58.070
<b>My people. If you're ever beset by
a tragedy that you cannot overcome,</b>

19:58.070 --> 19:59.320
<b>then come to me.</b>

19:59.900 --> 20:02.200
<b>I'll grant you that wish.</b>

20:02.950 --> 20:04.950
<b>And I want you to remember this,
if nothing else.</b>

20:05.450 --> 20:09.040
<b>First, this country will not tolerate hardship.</b>

20:09.040 --> 20:12.160
<b>Also, this country will not tolerate malice.</b>

20:12.160 --> 20:15.630
<b>And also, this country will not tolerate tragedy.</b>

20:15.630 --> 20:21.720
<b>If any of these are violated, the Demon King
of Tyranny will risk his life to defeat and destroy it.</b>

20:25.300 --> 20:28.680
<b>The true form of the Demon King,
who was called a tyrant...</b>

20:28.680 --> 20:30.720
<b>We will pour all our emotions into this song.</b>

20:31.480 --> 20:36.690
<b>Please listen.
This is Demonic Hymn No. 5, Peace.</b>

21:22.440 --> 21:24.070
<b>You did great, Misa.</b>

21:24.070 --> 21:25.450
<b>Lay...</b>

21:25.450 --> 21:28.490
<b>Then will you give me a reward sometime?</b>

21:28.490 --> 21:29.620
<b>You're a bad girl!</b>

21:29.620 --> 21:31.200
<b>What's so bad about that?</b>

21:31.200 --> 21:32.370
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

21:32.370 --> 21:33.950
<b>F-Father...</b>

21:34.330 --> 21:38.080
<b>What is it about Misa that you find objectionable?
Lay Glanzudlii!</b>

21:38.500 --> 21:42.000
<b>I-It's not true.
Right, Mother?</b>

21:42.210 --> 21:44.760
<b>I think that Misa's a bad girl, too!</b>

21:44.920 --> 21:47.800
<b>I just told you, it's not true.</b>

23:13.390 --> 23:14.640
<b>Good job.</b>

23:14.640 --> 23:18.850
<b>As usual, what an amazing song.
Everyone was sitting there stunned!</b>

23:19.140 --> 23:22.940
<b>That's what happens when one hears
someone pouring their souls into a song.</b>

23:23.110 --> 23:25.320
<b>I just know that's not right.</b>

23:25.690 --> 23:27.110
<b>So what is it?</b>

23:27.440 --> 23:28.820
<b>You know... that.</b>

23:29.030 --> 23:33.280
<b>The Sun of Ruin was shining...
so how did everyone survive?</b>

23:33.280 --> 23:38.120
<b>It's simple. The Sun of Ruin
didn't see you all as its enemy.</b>

23:39.080 --> 23:42.210
<b>It only destroyed Avos Dilhevia—
the one it was supposed to destroy.</b>

23:42.330 --> 23:44.710
<b>That's what I don't get.</b>

23:44.710 --> 23:46.630
<b>How could that happen?</b>

23:46.920 --> 23:49.210
<b>The Goddess of Destruction
was your enemy, wasn't she?</b>

23:49.460 --> 23:51.430
<b>I guess you could say that.</b>

23:51.430 --> 23:56.350
<b>Those were all lives that I couldn't
have saved unless I killed Abernyu. But...</b>

23:56.890 --> 23:58.850
<b>Just because it's the order of destruction...</b>

23:59.270 --> 24:01.640
<b>did you really think I'd ally myself
with the gods?</b>

24:02.310 --> 24:05.230
<b><i>How could that happen... eh?</i></b>

24:05.690 --> 24:06.820
<b>Is something wrong?</b>

24:07.520 --> 24:09.440
<b>I never anticipated this.</b>

24:10.320 --> 24:15.160
<b>Misha, do you remember seeing Venuzdnor
in the tower 2,000 years ago?</b>

24:16.620 --> 24:22.040
<b>I couldn't figure out who it was,
but the answer might actually have been simple.</b>

24:23.000 --> 24:24.210
<b>In other words, it was me.</b>

24:25.420 --> 24:28.550
<b>You mean that you activated
it yourself before you reincarnated?</b>

24:28.550 --> 24:30.170
<b>But I thought you didn't know.</b>

24:30.510 --> 24:32.630
<b>It might just be that I can't remember.</b>

24:32.630 --> 24:33.300
<b>What?</b>

24:33.300 --> 24:37.600
<b>After all, it's not like I have
an accurate memory of Abernyu.</b>

24:38.140 --> 24:43.270
<b>I was sure that the Sun of Ruin
wouldn't hurt us that day... but...</b>

24:43.270 --> 24:44.810
<b>...I can't remember why.</b>

24:44.810 --> 24:46.100
<b>You can't?</b>

24:46.810 --> 24:50.480
<b>I'm missing part of my memory.
Why is that?</b>
